A matched insertion or deletion hides a substitution's closer

```
{~a~>{+b~}+}~}
.
<p><del>a</del><ins><ins>b~}</ins></ins></p>
```

```
{~a~>{-b~}-}~}
.
<p><del>a</del><ins><del>b~}</del></ins></p>
```

```
{~{+b~>c+}~>a~}
.
<p><del><ins>b~&gt;c</ins></del><ins>a</ins></p>
```

```
{~{-b~>c-}~}
.
<p><s><del>b~&gt;c</del></s></p>
```
